#. front matter: title
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:2
msgid "WindowsでTftpd64を使用してTFTPサーバーを立てる"
msgstr "Set Up a TFTP Server on Windows Using Tftpd64"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:11
msgid ""
"Tftpd64は、Windows向けのTFTP、SNTP、SYSLOG、DHCP、DNSサーバーのソフトウェアで"
"す。"
msgstr ""
"Tftpd64 is software for Windows that provides TFTP, SNTP, SYSLOG, DHCP, and "
"DNS servers."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:13
msgid ""
"ここでは、Tftpd64を使用してWindows上でTFTPサーバーを立てる方法について説明し"
"ます。"
msgstr ""
"This article explains how to set up a TFTP server on Windows using Tftpd64."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:15
msgid "Tftpd64のインストール"
msgstr "Install Tftpd64"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:17
msgid ""
"[Tftpd64の公式サイト](https://pjo2.github.io/tftpd64/)のダウンロードページに"
"て、`Tftpd64-<バージョン>-setup.exe`というファイル名でインストーラーが配布さ"
"れています。インストーラーをダウンロードして実行しましょう。"
msgstr ""
"The Tftpd64 installer is available as a file named `Tftpd64-<version>-setup."
"exe` on the [Tftpd64 official website](https://pjo2.github.io/tftpd64/). "
"Download and run the installer."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:19
msgid "![Tftpd64インストーラー](images/tftpd64-install1.webp)"
msgstr "![Tftpd64 installer](images/tftpd64-install1.webp)"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:21
msgid ""
"ライセンスが表示されます。内容を確認し、「I Agree」を押して次へ進めましょう。"
msgstr "The license is displayed. Review it and select I Agree to continue."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:23
msgid "![Tftpd64インストーラー](images/tftpd64-install2.webp)"
msgstr "![Tftpd64 installer](images/tftpd64-install2.webp)"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:25
msgid ""
"インストール条件を設定できます。設定後、「Next」を押して次へ進めましょう。"
msgstr ""
"You can configure the installation options. After configuring them, select "
"Next to continue."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:27
msgid "![Tftpd64インストーラー](images/tftpd64-install3.webp)"
msgstr "![Tftpd64 installer](images/tftpd64-install3.webp)"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:29
msgid ""
"Tftpd64をインストールする場所を設定します。設定後、「Install」を押すことでイ"
"ンストールが開始されます。"
msgstr ""
"Choose where to install Tftpd64. After configuring the location, select "
"Install to start the installation."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:31
msgid "![Tftpd64インストーラー](images/tftpd64-install4.webp)"
msgstr "![Tftpd64 installer](images/tftpd64-install4.webp)"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:33
msgid ""
"画面上に「Completed!」と表示されればインストール完了です。「Close」を押してイ"
"ンストーラーを終了します。"
msgstr ""
"When Completed! is displayed on the screen, the installation is complete. "
"Select Close to exit the installer."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:35
msgid "Tftpd64の使い方"
msgstr "Use Tftpd64"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:37
msgid "インストールされた「tftpd64.exe」を実行してTftpd64を起動します。"
msgstr "Run the installed `tftpd64.exe` to launch Tftpd64."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:39
msgid "![Tftpd64](images/tftpd64-usage1.webp)"
msgstr "![Tftpd64](images/tftpd64-usage1.webp)"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:41
msgid "Tftpd64を起動したら、最初に「Settings」を押して設定画面を開きましょう。"
msgstr "After launching Tftpd64, select Settings to open the settings screen."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:43
msgid "![Tftpd64](images/tftpd64-usage2.webp)"
msgstr "![Tftpd64](images/tftpd64-usage2.webp)"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:45
msgid ""
"設定画面の「GLOBAL」タブでは、Tftpd64全体に関わる設定を変更できます。今回は"
"TFTPサーバーしか利用しないため、「TFTP Server」だけにチェックを付けましょう。"
msgstr ""
"The GLOBAL tab on the settings screen contains settings for Tftpd64 as a "
"whole. Since only the TFTP server is used in this example, select only TFTP "
"Server."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:47
msgid "![Tftpd64](images/tftpd64-usage3.webp)"
msgstr "![Tftpd64](images/tftpd64-usage3.webp)"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:49
msgid ""
"設定画面の「TFTP」タブでは、TFTPに関わる設定を変更出来ます。TFTPサーバーで公"
"開するベースディレクトリを「Base Directory」で設定しましょう。"
msgstr ""
"The TFTP tab contains settings related to TFTP. Set the base directory "
"published by the TFTP server in Base Directory."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:51
msgid ""
"Tftpd64はデフォルトの状態では、全てのネットワークインターフェースでTFTPクライ"
"アントからの通信を受け付けます。「Bind TFTP to this address」にチェックを入"
"れ、IPアドレスを指定することで、サーバーを公開するIPアドレスを指定することが"
"できます。"
msgstr ""
"By default, Tftpd64 accepts connections from TFTP clients on all network "
"interfaces. Select Bind TFTP to this address and specify an IP address to "
"choose the address on which the server is published."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:53
msgid "設定したら「OK」を押して設定を反映させてください。"
msgstr "After configuring the settings, select OK to apply them."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:55
msgid "![Tftpd64](images/tftpd64-usage4.webp)"
msgstr "![Tftpd64](images/tftpd64-usage4.webp)"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:57
msgid ""
"確認のダイアログが表示されます。「OK」を押すことでTftpd64が再起動されます。以"
"上でTFTPのセットアップは完了です。"
msgstr ""
"A confirmation dialog is displayed. Select OK to restart Tftpd64. The TFTP "
"setup is now complete."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:59
msgid ""
"フォルダに適当なファイルを置いて、実際にTFTPクライアントから取得してみましょ"
"う。"
msgstr ""
"Place an appropriate file in the directory and try retrieving it from a TFTP "
"client."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:61
msgid "![Tftpd64](images/tftpd64-usage5.webp)"
msgstr "![Tftpd64](images/tftpd64-usage5.webp)"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:63
msgid "TFTPクライアントからアクセス出来ていることを確認できました。"
msgstr "You can confirm that the TFTP client can access the server."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/setup-tftp-server-on-windows-using-tftpd64/index.md:65
msgid ""
"アクセスできない場合はIPアドレスやポートの設定、セキュリティソフトでブロック"
"されていないかを見直しましょう。"
msgstr ""
"If you cannot access the server, review the IP address and port settings and "
"check whether security software is blocking the connection."
